ECDSASessionValidator::validateSignatureWithData
├── given data encodes a non-zero signer
│   ├── when the signature is a valid [r,s,v] pack from that signer over the hash
│   │   └── it should return true
│   ├── when the signature is from a different signer
│   │   └── it should return false
│   └── when the signature is over a different hash
│       └── it should return false
└── given data encodes the zero address
    └── when any signature is checked
        └── it should return false
